/// [Party] A household that shares goals, obligations and delegated access. Frontier has one: household-bansal (Rhea, spouse Vivek, child Anika, parent Savitri). Access inside a household is resource-specific and asymmetric. Contoso extension entity: no CDM profile entity, BIAN status unmapped. Star role: dimension; grain: one household. Lakehouse: dim_household <- silver_household <- personas.json.
entity Household
	lineageTag: bb2f59ce-a1bc-530e-8b13-5f84beb5b024
	backingTable: Household
	keyProperty: HouseholdId

